                        "sense_id": "bed3a37f-0006-3a9a-a304-be7d2a262ec6",
                        "entry_id": "1dc83299-1540-3d77-92bc-af36b3558ded",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Definite."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Australia",
                            "Canada",
                            "Ireland",
                            "UK",
                            "colloquial",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "215ef019-3744-4d19-863a-f38f05f4670c",
                                "sense_id": "bed3a37f-0006-3a9a-a304-be7d2a262ec6",
                                "text": "I know for certain they′re not speaking to each other, that′s for deffo, not that I′ve even seen them in the same room over the last week to confirm their silence."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c7b73475-70b1-4cab-884b-cca27a936e8e",
                                "sense_id": "bed3a37f-0006-3a9a-a304-be7d2a262ec6",
                                "text": "‘An infection. Nothing serious. They′ll have some colour in them soon, for deffo.’"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5fcb05a1-803f-4f15-8096-9e1a1b191b82",
                                "sense_id": "bed3a37f-0006-3a9a-a304-be7d2a262ec6",
                                "text": "“Couldn′t say for deffo, probably at least fifteen years old, but I know they don′t make them like these any more for exactly the reason you′ve just seen. The security systems shite.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8f4cccfd-d831-4c61-9e33-bc5db4b2c41e",
                                "sense_id": "bed3a37f-0006-3a9a-a304-be7d2a262ec6",
                                "text": "Needles wilted under the force of Pegg′s demand, his eyes widened and he seemed to shrink in size, and I can′t say for deffo but I think he probably wet himself."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
