                        "entry_id": "a1376eb5-adfc-3f1d-b67c-ca5b22f90a77",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Definitely."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Australia",
                            "Canada",
                            "Ireland",
                            "UK",
                            "colloquial"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c25bf82e-116f-4edd-9e89-a950579e4cd1",
                                "sense_id": "e7148e10-bf2e-3d26-bc74-6070e069b5ec",
                                "text": "He told me that he's deffo going to be there tonight."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ede287f-7485-41ab-9843-32fa42c26580",
                                "sense_id": "e7148e10-bf2e-3d26-bc74-6070e069b5ec",
                                "text": "And I deffo don′t believe in me, cos I′m a proper knobhead, aren′t I, and always have been."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2a1bf332-c18f-46c6-9e57-8c9792867b1c",
                                "sense_id": "e7148e10-bf2e-3d26-bc74-6070e069b5ec",
                                "text": "It′s weird, but even though Dosser was only grounded for like two weeks, I was actually starting to kind of miss him, and I deffo would′ve loved to have gone for a good old-fashioned crow-hunt that Saturday afternoon,[…]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fce15f0b-8cb8-47ea-9a77-ed84e3c0f2ab",
                                "sense_id": "e7148e10-bf2e-3d26-bc74-6070e069b5ec",
                                "text": "‘[…]And no giving in at the slightest whimper. Agreed?’\n‘Deffo!’ He couldn′t see my fingers crossed behind my back."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
